hadiths[19]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1122","'Abdullah ibn 'Umar wrote to 'Abdu'l-Malik ibn Marwan in order\nto pledge him his allegiance. He wrote to him"
"1123","Zayd ibn Aslam said"
"1124","Hisham ibn 'Urwa said"
"1125","In the\nName of Allah"
"1126","Abu Mas'ud al-Jurayri related to him that a man asked al-Hasan\nabout reading"
"1127","Nafi' said"
"1128","In the Name of Allah"
"1129","'In the Name of Allah. It is for\nHim.'"
"1130","See 1122."
"1131","Abu Hurayra said"
"1132","Mahmud ibn Labid said"
"1133","It is related from Ka'b ibn Malik"
"1134","In the Name of Allah"
"1135","This\nis what I wanted to hear from you."
"1136","Jabir ibn 'Abdullah reported that the Prophet"
"1137","Muhajir (who is as-Sa'igh) said"
"1138","Sayf ibn Wahb reported that Abu't-Tufayl asked him"
"1139","'Abdu'r-Rahman ibn Abi 'Amra al-Ansari related to him"
"1140","Munqidh said"
